### ============================================
### HR PAYROLL SYSTEM - RBAC & AUTH API TESTS
### ============================================

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@contentType = application/json

### ============================================
### 1. AUTHENTICATION - ĐĂNG NHẬP & ĐĂNG KÝ
### ============================================

### 1.1. Đăng ký user mới (Register)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "newuser",
  "email": "newuser@company.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "phone": "0123456789",
  "dob": "1990-01-01",
  "gender": "Nam"
}

### 1.2. Đăng nhập - SUPER_ADMIN
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 1.3. Đăng nhập - HR_MANAGER
# @name loginHR
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "hr_manager",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 1.4. Đăng nhập - PAYROLL_ACCOUNTANT
# @name loginAccountant
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "accountant",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 1.5. Đăng nhập - EMPLOYEE
# @name loginEmployee
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "employee",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 1.6. Đăng nhập thất bại - Sai password
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### 1.7. Đăng nhập thất bại - User không tồn tại
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "nonexistentuser",
  "password": "password123"
}

### ============================================
### 2. USER MANAGEMENT - QUẢN LÝ NGƯỜI DÙNG
### ============================================

### 2.1. Lấy tất cả users với roles (SUPER_ADMIN, HR_MANAGER)
# Yêu cầu: Bearer token từ SUPER_ADMIN hoặc HR_MANAGER
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users-with-roles
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..xxx

### 2.2. Tạo user mới với roles (SUPER_ADMIN, HR_MANAGER)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/users
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.xxx

{
  "username": "sang12343",
  "email": "sang123@company.com",
  "password": "test123",
  "phone": "0987654321",
  "dob": "1995-05-15",
  "gender": "Nữ",
  "roleIds": [2, 4]
}

### 2.3. Cập nhật user (SUPER_ADMIN, HR_MANAGER)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/users/5
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.xxx

{
  "username": "testuser_updated",
  "email": "testuser_updated@company.com",
  "phone": "0999999999",
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### 2.4. Xóa user (SUPER_ADMIN only)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/users/5
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.xxx

### ============================================
### 3. ACCESS LOGS - LỊCH SỬ TRUY CẬP
### ============================================

### 3.1. Lấy tất cả access logs (SUPER_ADMIN, HR_MANAGER)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/access-logs
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.xxx

### 3.2. Lấy access logs (OLD endpoint - deprecated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/admin/logs
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.xxx

### ============================================
### 4. RBAC MANAGEMENT - QUẢN LÝ PHÂN QUYỀN
### ============================================

### 4.1. Lấy tất cả roles
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rbac/roles
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.xxx

### 4.2. Tạo role mới (SUPER_ADMIN only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rbac/roles
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.xxx

{
  "roleName": "MANAGER"
}

### 4.3. Lấy tất cả permissions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rbac/permissions
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.xxx

### 4.4. Tạo permission mới (SUPER_ADMIN only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rbac/permissions
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.xxx

{
  "permissionName": "SYSTEM_ADMIN"
}

### 4.5. Lấy tất cả system functions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rbac/functions
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.xxx

### 4.6. Gán role cho user (SUPER_ADMIN only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rbac/assign-role
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.xxx

{
  "userId": 5,
  "roleId": 2
}

### 4.7. Gán permission cho role (SUPER_ADMIN only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rbac/assign-permission
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.xxx

{
  "roleId": 5,
  "permissionId": 1
}

### 4.8. Lấy roles của user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rbac/user/1/roles
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.xxx

### 4.9. Lấy permissions của user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rbac/user/1/permissions
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.xxx

### ============================================
### 5. TEST AUTHORIZATION - KIỂM TRA PHÂN QUYỀN
### ============================================

### 5.1. Test: EMPLOYEE cố truy cập users-with-roles (Should FAIL - 403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users-with-roles
Authorization: Bearer <EMPLOYEE_TOKEN_HERE>

### 5.2. Test: EMPLOYEE cố truy cập access-logs (Should FAIL - 403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/access-logs
Authorization: Bearer <EMPLOYEE_TOKEN_HERE>

### 5.3. Test: HR_MANAGER truy cập users-with-roles (Should SUCCESS)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users-with-roles
Authorization: Bearer <HR_MANAGER_TOKEN_HERE>

### 5.4. Test: Không có token (Should FAIL - 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users-with-roles

### 5.5. Test: Token không hợp lệ (Should FAIL - 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users-with-roles
Authorization: Bearer invalid_token_here

### ============================================
### 6. EMAIL VERIFICATION & OTP
### ============================================

### 6.1. Request OTP cho đăng ký
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register/request-otp
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "newuser@company.com"
}

### 6.2. Verify OTP
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register/verify-otp
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "newuser@company.com",
  "otp": "123456"
}

### 6.3. Resend OTP
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register/resend-otp
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "newuser@company.com"
}

### 6.4. Verify email (từ link trong email)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/verify-email?token=verification_token_here

### ============================================
### 7. PASSWORD MANAGEMENT
### ============================================

### 7.1. Request password reset
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/password/reset-request
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "admin@company.com"
}

### 7.2. Reset password với token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/password/reset
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "token": "reset_token_here",
  "newPassword": "newpassword123"
}

### 7.3. Change password (khi đã đăng nhập)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/password/change
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.xxx

{
  "oldPassword": "admin123",
  "newPassword": "newadmin123"
}

### ============================================
### 8. TOKEN MANAGEMENT
### ============================================

### 8.1. Refresh access token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh-token
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "refreshToken": "refresh_token_here"
}

### 8.2. Logout (invalidate token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.xxx

### 8.3. Get current user info
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.xxx

### ============================================
### 9. DEPARTMENT MANAGEMENT (Protected)
### ============================================

### 9.1. Lấy tất cả departments (SUPER_ADMIN, HR_MANAGER)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/departments
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.xxx

### 9.2. Tạo department mới (SUPER_ADMIN, HR_MANAGER)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/departments
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.xxx

{
  "departmentName": "IT Department",
  "description": "Information Technology"
}

### ============================================
### 10. EMPLOYEE MANAGEMENT (Protected)
### ============================================

### 10.1. Lấy tất cả employees (All authenticated users)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/employees
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.xxx

### 10.2. Tạo employee mới (SUPER_ADMIN, HR_MANAGER)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/employees
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.xxx

{
  "fullName": "Nguyen Van A",
  "email": "nguyenvana@company.com",
  "phone": "0123456789",
  "departmentId": 1,
  "positionId": 1
}

### ============================================
### NOTES - HƯỚNG DẪN SỬ DỤNG
### ============================================

# 1. Đăng nhập trước để lấy token:
#    - Chạy request "1.2. Đăng nhập - SUPER_ADMIN"
#    - Copy token từ response
#    - Paste vào Authorization header của các request khác

# 2. Test phân quyền:
#    - Đăng nhập với các user khác nhau (admin, hr_manager, employee)
#    - Thử truy cập các endpoint khác nhau
#    - Kiểm tra response: 200 (OK), 401 (Unauthorized), 403 (Forbidden)

# 3. Sample Users:
#    - admin / admin123 → SUPER_ADMIN (full access)
#    - hr_manager / admin123 → HR_MANAGER (HR + Timekeeping + Reporting)
#    - accountant / admin123 → PAYROLL_ACCOUNTANT (Payroll + Reporting)
#    - employee / admin123 → EMPLOYEE (Self-service only)

# 4. Expected Responses:
#    - 200: Success
#    - 201: Created
#    - 400: Bad Request (validation error)
#    - 401: Unauthorized (no token or invalid token)
#    - 403: Forbidden (no permission)
#    - 404: Not Found
#    - 500: Internal Server Error

# 5. JWT Token Format:
#    Authorization: Bearer <token>
#    Token expires after 1 hour (configurable)

# 6. Role Permissions:
#    SUPER_ADMIN: All permissions
#    HR_MANAGER: HR_MANAGEMENT, TIMEKEEPING, REPORTING
#    PAYROLL_ACCOUNTANT: PAYROLL_MANAGEMENT, REPORTING
#    EMPLOYEE: SELF_SERVICE

